= Julián Zugazagoitia

Julián Zugazagoitia is the editor-in-chief of <span style="color: #c00000;">*El Socialista*</span>, the party's newspaper, and a <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> deputy. A close ally of Prieto, he uses the paper to argue for defending the Republic - including, when the danger is greatest, cooperation with the <span style="color: #700000;">**PCE**</span>.

- @media_
- @faction_support_
- @kpd_cooperation
- @root: Return to main


