Which faction should we support?

- @support_left: Caballerista left
- @support_center: Besteirista centre
- @support_labor: UGT
- @support_reform: Prietista reformists
- @support_neorev: Anti-fascist mobilization

@support_left
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 8; left_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Left"

*El Socialista* prints editorials in support of the Caballerista left.

@support_center
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 8; center_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Center"

*El Socialista* prints editorials in support of the Besteirista centre.

@support_labor
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 8; labor_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Labor"

*El Socialista* prints editorials in support of the trade unions.

@support_reform
on-arrival: reformist_dissent -= 8; reformist_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Reformists"

*El Socialista* prints editorials in support of the Prietista reformists.

@support_neorev
view-if: neorevisionism
on-arrival: neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_strength += 8; editorial_line = "Neorevisionists"; nazi_urgency += 1

*El Socialista* prints editorials in support of anti-fascist mobilization.

